{"content": {"exact_text": "collecting such large-scale traffic for training is timeconsuming and may incur privacy leakage", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.414099Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "limitation", "id": "E0011", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": "this limitation is stated about the pre-training-based alternatives the paper rejects, not about RAPIER itself", "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.06, "y0": 119.05, "y1": 328.31}, "block": "B0032", "char_end": 783, "char_start": 688, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 3, "section_path": ["III. PROBLEM STATEMENT"], "text_hash": "sha256:eb4a3a71eaa988f97abafc849938d0bc15cac49f59b04a587d7ffb0606135b73", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:48.975462Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states this limitation verbatim.", "review_action": "accept_with_qualification", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:48.975445Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "since the malware evolves consistently, the captured malware samples have insufficient time sensitivity", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.416360Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "limitation", "id": "E0012", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 319.0, "x1": 571.1, "y0": 206.83, "y1": 361.3}, "block": "B0007", "char_end": 193, "char_start": 90, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 1, "section_path": ["for Detecting Encrypted Malicious Network Traffic"], "text_hash": "sha256:f29ee8246c0a891b8ba9c1d112980b66e46f732d7403e0208d9e5ce2b76ab64b", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:54.098310Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states the dataset-age limitation.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:54.098292Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "We implement RAPIER and perform extensive evaluations based on two public datasets and one combined dataset.", "field": "traffic.dataset", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.178017Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_setup", "id": "E0016", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": "the span states how many datasets were used but names none of them; it cannot stand alone as the dataset answer", "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.07, "y0": 399.94, "y1": 620.16}, "block": "B0019", "char_end": 427, "char_start": 319, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 2, "section_path": ["I. INTRODUCTION"], "text_hash": "sha256:ad8d295c706d102fbe669bb40ea44b7f22a038407cd777234ae5c08374bc9bfc", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:14.880959Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span gives the count of datasets but names none of them, so it does not answer which datasets were used.", "review_action": "accept_with_qualification", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:14.880943Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "partially_supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "We evaluate RAPIER with a real-world dataset collected by a security enterprise.", "field": "traffic.dataset", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.180286Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "dataset_description", "id": "E0017", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.07, "y0": 399.94, "y1": 620.16}, "block": "B0019", "char_end": 799, "char_start": 719, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 2, "section_path": ["I. INTRODUCTION"], "text_hash": "sha256:ad8d295c706d102fbe669bb40ea44b7f22a038407cd777234ae5c08374bc9bfc", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:20.162208Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span establishes a fourth, private dataset.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:20.162188Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "we propose a novel feature extraction module to convert raw encrypted network traffic into feature vectors representing fine-grained behaviors", "field": "traffic.representation_family", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:01.993403Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "representation_description", "id": "E0025", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.06, "y0": 171.91, "y1": 392.13}, "block": "B0018", "char_end": 204, "char_start": 62, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 2, "section_path": ["I. INTRODUCTION"], "text_hash": "sha256:816fabe8f64b0d604d75fecf0ddfe59bfcef96fe3e779d9f0aa766b14f48a05e", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:12.302251Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states that the representation is behaviour feature vectors.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:12.302232Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "we aim at addressing a realworld low-quality training dataset problem, namely, detecting encrypted malicious traffic generated by continuously evolving malware", "field": "traffic.encryption_status", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.251305Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_setup", "id": "E0026", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.07, "y0": 209.16, "y1": 447.26}, "block": "B0008", "char_end": 521, "char_start": 362, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 1, "section_path": ["for Detecting Encrypted Malicious Network Traffic"], "text_hash": "sha256:ddcce0c7b6af16ad982da5a44b007a6d29123c815b932af2a13e82911a793fc8", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:17.371988Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span establishes that the traffic is encrypted.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:17.371970Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "RAPIER effectively achieves the F1 scores of 0.770, 0.776, and 0.855 on the three datasets, respectively", "field": "traffic.metrics", "negative_state": null, "numeric": {"condition": {"noise_ratio": "45%", "training_samples": "1000"}, "dataset": "first of the three RAPIER evaluation datasets", "metric": "F1", "parsed": 0.77, "raw": "0.770", "source_column": null, "source_row": null, "source_table": "B0019", "unit": null}}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:02.349963Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_result", "id": "E0027", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 48.96, "x1": 301.07, "y0": 399.94, "y1": 620.16}, "block": "B0019", "char_end": 627, "char_start": 523, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 2, "section_path": ["I. INTRODUCTION"], "text_hash": "sha256:ad8d295c706d102fbe669bb40ea44b7f22a038407cd777234ae5c08374bc9bfc", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:22.418995Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states the metric and the three values under the stated training condition.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:22.418977Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "let (xi, yi) be the pair of an encrypted sample xi (e.g., a flow or a session between two hosts) and its true label", "field": "traffic.traffic_unit", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:25:01.929939Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "method_description", "id": "E0036", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212458Z_52260489", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0004-1", "bbox": {"x0": 319.0, "x1": 571.11, "y0": 702.33, "y1": 736.47}, "block": "B0028", "char_end": 124, "char_start": 9, "file_hash": "sha256:09a72a81c237f3b4c82b5a564e4a029649de1b0142a1252521e35d6f97ce1c0c", "page": 2, "section_path": ["III. PROBLEM STATEMENT"], "text_hash": "sha256:6416d13543d6f0d1953504510a0bb534f8453d7eab319a4e02f5fd29d74b0cd7", "version": "V0004-1", "work": "W0004"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:40:08.623043Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The problem statement names flow and session as the sample.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:40:08.623023Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
